{
  "_readme": "Intent Mode config. Edit with: sudo nano '/Library/Application Support/IntentMode/config.json' — the daemon reloads it within 5 seconds (check daemon.log for errors; an invalid file is ignored and the last good one stays active). Domain entries: 'example.com' = example.com and all subdomains; '=www.example.com' = exactly that name; '@group' = everything in domain_groups.group. Apps are matched by bundle ID; team_id pins the code signature ('apple' for Apple apps; find others with: intentmode inspect-app /Applications/Foo.app). Modes with \"open_web\": true allow every site except the adult filter and their blocked_domains. Adult content: blocklist_files (big public lists, refreshed weekly, add-only) + always_blocked_domains (your own groups, e.g. adult_extra) apply in EVERY mode; add your own sites to domain_groups.adult_extra or to blocklists/custom.txt. A wrongly blocked site can go into blocklist_exceptions. bedtime: only allowed_modes can be used between start and end; other sessions end at bedtime. idle_end_minutes: sessions end after that long without keyboard/mouse input. cooldown_minutes (per mode): wait time after a session of that mode.",
